[31m-## How It Works (Summary)[m
[31m-[m
[31m-1. On `enable()`, connects to UDisks2 over D-Bus and enumerates mounted USB drives[m
[31m-2. Subscribes to D-Bus signals for dynamic hotplug/unmount tracking[m
[31m-3. Starts a 2-second GLib polling loop[m
[31m-4. Each tick: reads `/sys/block/<dev>/stat` for every tracked device, computes sector deltas[m
[31m-5. Per-device state machine filters metadata writes and tracks real file copy bursts[m
[31m-6. Top-bar indicator shows live progress; hides when idle[m
[31m-7. Desktop notification fires when all pending writes are flushed[m
[31m-8. On `disable()`, all timers, signal subscriptions, and UI elements are cleaned up[m
[31m-[m
